<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Elandsrand, Deelkraal renew cautionary.</title>
<headline>Elandsrand, Deelkraal renew cautionary.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Elandsrand Gold Mining Co Ltd and Deelkraal Gold Mining Co Ltd said on Friday that there had been no further developments in their continuing talks.</p>
<p>The companies' shareholders were advised to continue exercising caution in their share dealings.</p>
<p>The two mines first announced talks aimed at a possible tie-up on August 23. The neighbouring mines said at that time the target was realising benefits which could be achieved through joint-action.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
